---
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="relative pt-24 pb-12 px-4 border-t border-white/[0.06]">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl">
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-4 gap-10 mb-12">
      <div class="md:col-span-2">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5 mb-4">
          <img src="/logo.png" alt="Looper" width="32" height="32" class="w-8 h-8 object-contain invert" />
          <span class="font-semibold tracking-tight text-lg">Looper</span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-white/50 text-sm max-w-md leading-relaxed">
          本地跑的工作流桌面应用。让 loop agent 通过本机 Claude Code,把多步任务从"聊一次"沉淀成"跑一条流水线"。
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <div class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-white/40 mb-4">产品</div>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm">
          <li><a href="#features" class="text-white/70 hover:text-white transition-colors">功能</a></li>
          <li><a href="#showcase" class="text-white/70 hover:text-white transition-colors">场景</a></li>
          <li><a href="#download" class="text-white/70 hover:text-white transition-colors">下载</a></li>
          <li><a href="#changelog" class="text-white/70 hover:text-white transition-colors">更新日志</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div>
        <div class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-white/40 mb-4">资源</div>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm">
          <li><a href="#" class="text-white/70 hover:text-white transition-colors">文档</a></li>
          <li><a href="#faq" class="text-white/70 hover:text-white transition-colors">FAQ</a></li>
          <li><a href="mailto:hi@example.com" class="text-white/70 hover:text-white transition-colors">联系我们</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="pt-8 border-t border-white/[0.06] flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-3 text-xs text-white/40">
      <div>© {year} Looper</div>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-5">
        <a href="#" class="hover:text-white/70 transition-colors">隐私政策</a>
        <a href="#" class="hover:text-white/70 transition-colors">许可证</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- 底部大字装饰 -->
  <div class="relative mt-16 select-none pointer-events-none overflow-hidden -mb-6">
    <div class="text-[14vw] font-black text-center leading-[0.85] tracking-tighter bg-gradient-to-b from-white/[0.05] via-white/[0.02] to-transparent bg-clip-text text-transparent pb-4">
      LOOPER
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
